            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of an Erythromycin-Resistant Propionibacterium acnes Isolate Recovered from Folliculitis of the Scalp.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01490-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01490-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Propionibacterium acnes is now well-known and recognized for its implication in the pathogenesis of acne vulgaris. Here, we report the draft genome sequence of an erythromycin-resistant P. acnes strain isolated from a case of folliculitis of the scalp belonging to phylotype IA1 and sequence type 18 (ST18).</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Aubin et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
